<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>Lesson Summary</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01159</md:content-id>
    <md:title>Lesson Summary</md:title>
    <md:uuid>42f164d8-bd68-4edc-b1c4-840053dfcc8d</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
    <section id="sect-00001">
      <para id="para-00001">In this lesson, you learned how to:</para>
      <list id="list-00001">
        <item>Explain what it means for a sequence to be arithmetic or geometric. </item>
      </list>
      <para id="para-00002">Here are the <emphasis>activities</emphasis> that helped you reach those goals:</para>
      <list id="list-00002">
        <item>4.16.1: Interpreting Function Notation <list id="list-00003">
            <item>In this activity, you mentally evaluated functions given a function in function notation. </item>
          </list>
        </item>

        <item>4.16.2: What Is an Arithmetic Sequence? <list id="list-00004">
            <item>In this activity, you learned what makes a sequence arithmetic. </item>
            <item>4.16.2: Self Check</item>
            <item>4.16.2: Additional Resources</item>
          </list>
        </item>

        <item>4.16.3: A Sequence Is a Type of Function <list id="list-00005">
            <item>In this activity, you represented a sequence in a graph and discussed if it could be geometric or arithmetic. </item>
            <item>4.16.3: Self Check</item>
            <item>4.16.3: Additional Resources</item>
          </list>
        </item>

        <item>4.16.4: Identify and Generate Sequences <list id="list-00006">
            <item>In this activity, you completed the same sequence with different terms to make it arithmetic, then geometric, and then neither. </item>
          </list>
        </item>

      </list>
      <para id="para-00003">After these activities, you completed the following <emphasis>practice</emphasis>:</para>
      <list id="list-00007">
        <item>4.16.5: Practice </item>
      </list>
      <note class="checking-in" id="sect-00002">
        <title>Checking In</title>
        <exercise id="_75e54e0b-b165-496a-98b8-25a5f4f52a92" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem id="prob-00001">
            <para id="para-00004">On a scale of 1 to 5, how confident do you feel about the learning goals of this lesson?</para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00001">
            <para id="para-00005">Nice reflection! You learn more when you take the time to reflect on your thinking.</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
      </note>
    </section>
  </content>
</document>